"\\f[B]Debian:\\f[R] Xfce (standard), Flux (minimum), LXQt (Bookworm/Trixie "
"only)\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]Debian:\\f[R] Xfce (standard), Flux (minimo), LXQt (solo Bookworm/"
